.TH DANBY-VENUSHEAD 1
.SH NAME
danby-venushead \- curved atmospheric light path around Venus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/venushead
.SH MODEL
A ray equation couples radial position and direction through an atmospheric
refractive-index gradient. The diagram compares the curved ray with planetary
radius and observer position; wrapped angle measures whether it returns behind
the observer.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/venushead.b
